--- !u!114 &3266280366492827268
MonoBehaviour:
  m_ObjectHideFlags: 0
  m_CorrespondingSourceObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabInstance: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabAsset: {fileID: 0}
  m_GameObject: {fileID: 8169718386658055680}
  m_Enabled: 1
  m_EditorHideFlags: 0
  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: ea6fd94ccb08b604482e63f67d8582ae, type: 3}
  m_Name: 
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: Assembly-CSharp::LoadingTipsUI
  loadingTipHeaderGO: {fileID: 7272770100890103971}
  loadingTipDescGO: {fileID: 2894473326267129225}
  tipCG: {fileID: 1253249475038916513}
  loadingTips:
  - loadingTipHeader: 
    loadingTipDesc: 
  - loadingTipHeader: 
    loadingTipDesc: 
  - loadingTipHeader: 
    loadingTipDesc: 
  - loadingTipHeader: 
    loadingTipDesc: 
  - loadingTipHeader: 
    loadingTipDesc: 
  - loadingTipHeader: 
    loadingTipDesc: 
  - loadingTipHeader: 
    loadingTipDesc: 
  - loadingTipHeader: 
    loadingTipDesc: 
  - loadingTipHeader: 
    loadingTipDesc: 
  loadingTipsAltar:
  - loadingTipHeader: Soulwards
    loadingTipDesc: Within each of the shattered lands resides a Soulward, powerful
      beings whose souls have been marked by the will of Death to be placed upon
      the Altar. With their strength, the world may live on.
  - loadingTipHeader: The Altar
    loadingTipDesc: This place was never meant for the eyes of living mortals.
  - loadingTipHeader: Moon Fragments
    loadingTipDesc: Old whispers say that the moon was once whole until Life took
      a fragment of its light and with it birthed the Altar, from which the world
      would grow.
  - loadingTipHeader: Longing
    loadingTipDesc: "The girl\u2019s mother could not grant her wish. She faded into
      exile, far from the Altar, never to see her again, never without the grief
      of her loss.\r\n"
  loadingTipsAltarLateGame:
  - loadingTipHeader: Beloved.
    loadingTipDesc: The time has come to choose for this world.
  - loadingTipHeader: Beloved.
    loadingTipDesc: Whatever may come, please, grant me mercy.
  - loadingTipHeader: Beloved.
    loadingTipDesc: Mother, beloved, I shall always miss you.
  - loadingTipHeader: Beloved.
    loadingTipDesc: You are so much like her.
  loadingTipsVita:
  - loadingTipHeader: Illusions
    loadingTipDesc: Much of Vita is cloaked by illusions, silver-white with a gentle
      peace that could never be reality.
  - loadingTipHeader: Arcs of Life
    loadingTipDesc: A long age ago, this land was blessed by the hand of Life.
  loadingTipsRitus:
  - loadingTipHeader: The Unbecoming
    loadingTipDesc: It is said by some shades that the fractured lord of Ritus brought
      the Unbecoming to the mortal world.
  - loadingTipHeader: The Bound Lord
    loadingTipDesc: This land is filled with those who revel to the Bound Lord. To
      them, he is deliverance, while he acknowledges not even their existence.
  - loadingTipHeader: Old Records
    loadingTipDesc: "An ancient mortal saying is recorded within many scriptures:
      \u201CWhen grief burns, its ashes birth fury.\u201D"
  loadingTipsMors:
  - loadingTipHeader: Warriors
    loadingTipDesc: "This land was once known for the strength of its warriors. They
      sought the Altar in the Unbecoming, only to sink into the moon\u2019s shadow,
      never to be seen again."
  loadingTipsNihil:
  - loadingTipHeader: Arcs of Death
    loadingTipDesc: "Once, before it was darkened by a vast grief in the Unbecoming,
      this land was home to a distant kingdom that looked upon the moon\u2019s fracture."
  - loadingTipHeader: The Eternal End
    loadingTipDesc: "Those that once inhabited Nihil revered what they called \u201Cthe
      eternal end.\u201D"
